# Bnood بنود

Local-first app for finishing/site engineers (formerly عهدة). **Docs:** [README](../../README.md), [scope](../../docs/scope.md).

- V1: single engineer, Drift/SQLite, no auth/sync/subscription/team UI.
- Arabic-first UX; **English** for commits, PRs, rules, and `docs/`.
- Money: integer **piastres** only — see [data-schema](../../docs/data-schema.md).
- Do not implement backend, sync, or SaaS unless scope explicitly expands.

Unresolved items: [open-questions](../../docs/open-questions.md). Do not guess closed behavior.
